HCPL-354
AC Input Phototransistor Optocoupler
SMD Mini-Flat Type




Description                                                     Features
The Broadcom® HCPL-354 contains a phototransistor,                 AC input response
optically coupled to two LEDs connected inverse parallel. It       Current transfer ratio
can operate directly by AC input current. It is packaged in a       (CTR: min. 20% at IF = ± 1 mA, VCE = 5V)
4-pin mini-flat SMD package with a 2.0-mm profile. The
                                                                   Isolation voltage between input and output
small dimension of this product allows significant space            (Viso = 3,750 Vrms)
savings. The package volume is 30% smaller than that of
                                                                   Subminiature type
conventional DIP type. Input-output isolation voltage is
                                                                    (The volume is smaller than that of conventional DIP
3750 Vrms. Response time, tr, is typically 4 µs and minimum
                                                                    type by as far as 30%)
CTR is 20% at input current of ±1 mA.
