CAUTION! Take normal static precautions in handling and assembly of this component to prevent damage and/or
         degradation that might be induced by electrostatic discharge (ESD). The components featured in this data
         sheet are not to be used in military or aerospace applications or environments. The components are not
         AEC-Q100 qualified and not recommended for automotive applications.



