Ordering Information
HCPL-354 is UL Recognized with 3750 Vrms for 1 minute per UL1577 and is approved under CSA Component Acceptance
Notice #5, File CA 88324.

                      RoHS Compliant Option

                     Rank '0’        'Rank 'A’                Surface    Gull   Tape and         IEC/EN
Part Number       20%<CTR<400%    50%<CTR<150%      Package    Mount     Wing     Reel          60747-5-5             Quantity
HCPL-354              -000E            -00AE         SO-4        X                  X                           3000 pieces per
